@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - UC-15 - Review Distraction Log

autonumber
actor Learner
participant "Desktop UI" as UI
participant "DistractionController" as Controller
participant "QueryDistractionLogUseCase" as UseCase
participant "DistractionLogReadRepository" as Repo
participant "DistractionLogMapper" as Mapper

Learner -> UI : open session detail or Analytics > Distractions
UI -> Controller : GET /api/v1/distractions?sessionId=...&from=...&to=...
Controller -> UseCase : list(query)
UseCase -> UseCase : validate(query)

alt session filter
  UseCase -> Repo : findBySession(sessionId)
else range filter
  UseCase -> Repo : findByRange(from, to)
end
Repo --> UseCase : List<DistractionLog>
UseCase -> Mapper : toDtos(logs)
Mapper --> UseCase : List<DistractionDto>
UseCase --> Controller : List<DistractionDto>
Controller --> UI : 200 OK\n{items}

note over Repo
  DistractionLog is a read model.
  The query is read-only; entries are
  append-only and retention-aware.
end note

note over UI
  Entries can be grouped by category and
  filtered by action. Window titles are
  redacted when the category policy requires it.
end note

@enduml
